B.Z8=s(["When you create or connect an account, we may process your account identifier, display name, email address supplied by your sign-in provider, and profile or avatar choices. Guest play may use an anonymous account identifier.","To run First Guess, we store information such as your game progress, XP, scores, achievements, challenge history, league participation and leaderboard entries.","When you use the app or website, technical information such as device and browser details, IP address, app performance information, crash reports and security logs may be processed by us or our service providers. Support enquiries may include information you choose to send us."],t.s)
B.aqm=new A.o3("INFORMATION WE COLLECT",B.Z8,null)
B.a_u=s(["Depending on applicable law, you may have rights to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information, and to object to or restrict certain uses.","You can request deletion of a signed-in First Guess account through the Delete Account option where available. You can also contact RhiPlay Support about privacy requests or if the in-app option is unavailable. Submitting a request does not necessarily mean deletion is immediately complete."],t.s)
B.aqn=new A.o3("YOUR CHOICES AND RIGHTS",B.a_u,null)
