B.aqo=new A.o3("HOW INFORMATION MAY BE USED",B.a05,null)
B.Z5=s(["We retain account and game information while your account is active or while it is needed to provide the service. When an account-deletion request is processed, account and associated gameplay data are scheduled for removal, subject to any information we must retain for legal, security or fraud-prevention reasons."],t.s)
B.aqp=new A.o3("DATA RETENTION",B.Z5,null)
